    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "questionText": "Как уменьшить размер Docker образа?",
    "shortAnswer": "Пять техник: multi-stage + slim base (alpine/distroless/scratch), single RUN с cleanup cache, .dockerignore, --no-install-recommends и --omit=dev. Аудит: docker history или dive.",
    "idealAnswer": "1) Multi-stage: build в node:22-alpine, final nginx:alpine — 1.2GB→30MB. 2) Base: alpine 7MB, distroless 20MB, scratch 0. Caveat: musl vs glibc для NumPy. 3) Single RUN: apt update && install && rm lists в одном layer — иначе cache в layer навсегда. 4) .dockerignore: .git, node_modules. 5) npm ci --omit=dev, apt --no-install-recommends. Inspect: docker history, dive. Ошибки: ADD bigfile + rm next layer — data остаётся; apt recommended; node:latest 1GB vs node:22-alpine 200MB. Go: FROM scratch + -ldflags -s -w.",
